27;evenodd&#x27;%20d=&#x27;m11.9893%2042.9689-6.20107-.0002c-3.1966-.0001-5.78791334-2.5915-5.78794897-5.7881l-.00028103-25.2123h5.65386v5.666h6.33544v4.9069h-6.33544v14.2029c0%20.6393.51825%201.1576%201.15756%201.1576l5.17788.0003z&#x27;%20fill-rule=&#x27;evenodd&#x27;/%3e%3c/g%3e%3crect%20fill=&#x27;transparent&#x27;%20height=&#x27;21.3087&#x27;%20rx=&#x27;10.6544&#x27;%20width=&#x27;32.7507&#x27;%20x=&#x27;120.626&#x27;%20y=&#x27;.094238&#x27;/%3e%3cellipse%20cx=&#x27;131.381&#x27;%20cy=&#x27;10.7489&#x27;%20fill=&#x27;%23fff&#x27;%20rx=&#x27;5.88628&#x27;%20ry=&#x27;5.87979&#x27;/%3e%3cpath%20d=&#x27;m149.128%2010.7489-10.002%205.7029v-11.4059z&#x27;%20fill=&#x27;%23fff&#x27;/%3e%3c/svg%3e" alt="Tavus"/></a><a href="https://headshotpro.com" class="inline-flex logo-grid-item flex-1 min-w-0 items-center justify-center"><img class="w-full object-contain max-h-12 xl:max-h-12 relative " src="https://static.replicateassets.com/fe/e288f9a0d0c8928629c5d924f083e98eed845bf1/headshot-pro-CJdoeg2d.svg" alt="Headshot Pro"/></a><a href="https://magnific.ai" class="inline-flex logo-grid-item flex-1 min-w-0 items-center justify-center"><img class="w-full object-contain max-h-12 xl:max-h-12 relative " src="https://static.replicateassets.com/fe/e288f9a0d0c8928629c5d924f083e98eed845bf1/magnific-BluKC6VB.png" alt="Magnific"/></a></div></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 lg:gap-16"><div class="border-l border-t border-branding-red"><div class="min-h-[14rem] mb-8 relative"><div class="flex flex-col gap-8 p-4"><div class="h-[100px] w-full"></div><div class="h-[100px] w-full"></div></div></div><div class="p-4 space-y-1.5"><div class="text-branding-red text-r8-2xl lg:text-r8-3xl font-semibold font-heading"><h4>Automatic scale</h4></div><div class="text-white text-r8-lg"><p>If you get a ton of traffic, Replicate scales up automatically to handle the demand. If you don&#x27;t get any traffic, we scale down to zero and don&#x27;t charge you a thing.</p></div></div></div><div class="border-l border-t border-branding-red"><div class="min-h-[14rem] mb-8 relative"><div class="px-4 pt-4"><ul class="divide-y divide-white/20 border-t border-white/20"><li class="p-2 last:pb-0 flex items-center justify-between"><span class="font-mono text-r8-sm">CPU</span><span class="font-mono text-r8-sm text-white/70">$0.000100<!-- -->/sec</span></li><li class="p-2 last:pb-0 flex items-center justify-between"><span class="font-mono text-r8-sm">Nvidia T4 GPU</span><span class="font-mono text-r8-sm text-white/70">$0.000225<!-- -->/sec</span></li><li class="p-2 last:pb-0 flex items-center justify-between"><span class="font-mono text-r8-sm">Nvidia L40S GPU</span><span class="font-mono text-r8-sm text-white/70">$0.000975<!-- -->/sec</span></li><li class="p-2 last:pb-0 flex items-center justify-between"><span class="font-mono text-r8-sm">2x Nvidia L40S GPU</span><span class="font-mono text-r8-sm text-white/70">$0.001950<!-- -->/sec</span></li><li class="p-2 last:pb-0 flex items-center justify-between"><span class="font-mono text-r8-sm">Nvidia A100 (80GB) GPU</span><span class="font-mono text-r8-sm text-white/70">$0.001400<!-- -->/sec</span></li><li class="p-2 last:pb-0 flex items-center justify-between"><span class="font-mono text-r8-sm">8x Nvidia A100 (80GB) GPU</span><span class="font-mono text-r8-sm text-white/70">$0.011200<!-- -->/sec</span></li><li class="pb-0"><a class="hover:underline p-2 flex items-center justify-between text-branding-red" href="https://replicate.com/pricing"><span class="font-mono text-r8-sm">Learn more about pricing</span><span class="font-mono text-r8-sm text-branding-red"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256"><path d="M224.49,136.49l-72,72a12,12,0,0,1-17-17L187,140H40a12,12,0,0,1,0-24H187L135.51,64.48a12,12,0,0,1,17-17l72,72A12,12,0,0,1,224.49,136.49Z"></path></svg></span></a></li></ul></div></div><div class="p-4 space-y-1.5"><div class="text-branding-red text-r8-2xl lg:text-r8-3xl font-semibold font-heading"><h4>Pay for what you use</h4></div><div class="text-white text-r8-lg"><p>Replicate only bills you for how long your code is running. You don&#x27;t pay for expensive GPUs when you&#x27;re not using them.</p></div></div></div><div class="border-l border-t border-branding-red"><div class="min-h-[14rem] mb-8 relative"><img class="relative -left-px -top-px" loading="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg%20width=&#x27;430&#x27;%20height=&#x27;235&#x27;%20viewBox=&#x27;0%200%20430%20235&#x27;%20fill=&#x27;none&#x27;%20xmlns=&#x27;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#x27;%3e%3crect%20x=&#x27;0.5&#x27;%20y=&#x27;0.5&#x27;%20width=&#x27;156&#x27;%20height=&#x27;156&#x27;%20stroke=&#x27;%23ED2E28&#x27;/%3e%3crect%20x=&#x27;234.5&#x27;%20y=&#x27;0.5&#x27;%20width=&#x27;156&#x27;%20height=&#x27;156&#x27;%20stroke=&#x27;%23ED2E28&#x27;/%3e%3crect%20x=&#x27;390.5&#x27;%20y=&#x27;0.5&#x27;%20width=&#x27;39&#x27;%20height=&#x27;39&#x27;%20stroke=&#x27;%23ED2E28&#x27;/%3e%3crect%20x=&#x27;390.5&#x27;%20y=&#x27;39.5&#x27;%20width=&#x27;39&#x27;%20height=&#x27;39&#x27;%20fill=&#x27;url(%23paint0_linear_1_2)&#x27;/%3e%3crect%20x=&#x27;390.5&#x27;%20y=&#x27;39.5&#x27;%20width=&#x27;39&#x27;%20height=&#x27;39&#x27;%20stroke=&#x27;%23ED2E28&#x27;/%3e%3crect%20x=&#x27;156.5&#x27;%20y=&#x27;0.5&#x27;%20width=&#x27;78&#x27;%20height=&#x27;78&#x27;%20stroke=&#x27;%23ED2E28&#x27;/%3e%3crect%20x=&#x27;233.5&#x27;%20y=&#x27;156.5&#x27;%20width=&#x27;78&#x27;%20height=&#x27;78&#x27;%20stroke=&#x27;%23ED2E28&#x27;/%3e%3crect%20x=&#x27;156.5&#x27;%20y=&#x27;156.5&#x27;%20width=&#x27;78&#x27;%20height=&#x27;78&#x27;%20stroke=&#x27;%23ED2E28&#x27;/%3e%3crect%20x=&#x27;156.5&#x27;%20y=&#x27;78.5&#x27;%20width=&#x27;39&#x27;%20height=&#x27;39&#x27;%20stroke=&#x27;%23ED2E28&#x27;/%3e%3crect%20x=&#x27;78.5&#x27;%20y=&#x27;156.5&#x27;%20width=&#x27;39&#x27;%20height=&#x27;39&#x27;%20fill=&#x27;url(%23paint1_linear_1_2)&#x27;/%3e%3crect%20x=&#x27;78.5&#x27;%20y=&#x27;156.5&#x27;%20width=&#x27;39&#x27;%20height=&#x27;39&#x27;%20stroke=&#x27;%23ED2E28&#x27;/%3e%3crect%20x=&#x27;39.5&#x27;%20y=&#x27;156.5&#x27;%20width=&#x27;39&#x27;%20height=&#x27;39&#x27;%20stroke=&#x27;%23ED2E28&#x27;/%3e%3crect%20x=&#x27;0.5&#x27;%20y=&#x27;156.5&#x27;%20width=&#x27;39&#x27;%20height=&#x27;39&#x27;%20stroke=&#x27;%23ED2E28&#x27;/%3e%3crect%20x=&#x27;195.5&#x27;%20y=&#x27;78.5&#x27;%20width=&#x27;39&#x27;%20height=&#x27;39&#x27;%20stroke=&#x27;%23ED2E28&#x27;/%3e%3crect%20x=&#x27;117.5&#x27;%20y=&#x27;156.5&#x27;%20width=&#x27;39&#x27;%20height=&#x27;39&#x27;%20stroke=&#x27;%23ED2E28&#x27;/%3e%3crect%20x=&#x27;195.5&#x27;%20y=&#x27;117.5&#x27;%20width=&#x27;39&#x27;%20height=&#x27;39&#x27;%20fill=&#x27;url(%23paint2_linear_1_2)&#x27;/%3e%3crect%20x=&#x27;195.5&#x27;%20y=&#x27;117.5&#x27;%20width=&#x27;39&#x27;%20height=&#x27;39&#x27;%20stroke=&#x27;%23ED2E28&#x27;/%3e%3crect%20x=&#x27;117.5&#x27;%20y=&#x27;195.5&#x27;%20width=&#x27;39&#x27;%20height=&#x27;39&#x27;%20fill=&#x27;url(%23paint3_linear_1_2)&#x27;/%3e%3crect%20x=&#x27;117.5&#x27;%20y=&#x27;195.5&#x27;%20width=&#x27;39&#x27;%20height=&#x27;39&#x27;%20stroke=&#x27;%23ED2E28&#x27;/%3e%3crect%20x=&#x27;156.5&#x27;%20y=&#x27;117.5&#x27;%20width=&#x27;39&#x27;%20height=&#x27;39&#x27;%20stroke=&#x27;%23ED2E28&#x27;/%3e%3crect%20x=&#x27;78.5&#x27;%20y=&#x27;195.5&#x27;%20width=&#x27;39&#x27;%20height=&#x27;39&#x27;%20stroke=&#x27;%23ED2E28&#x27;/%3e%3crect%20x=&#x27;39.5&#x27;%20y=&#x27;195.5&#x27;%20width=&#x27;39&#x27;%20height=&#x27;39&#x27;%20stroke=&#x27;%23ED2E28&#x27;/%3e%3crect%20x=&#x27;0.5&#x27;%20y=&#x27;195.5&#x27;%20width=&#x27;39&#x27;%20height=&#x27;39&#x27;%20stroke=&#x27;%23ED2E28&#x27;/%3e%3cdefs%3e%3clinearGradient%20id=&#x27;paint0_linear_1_2&#x27;%20x1=&#x27;430&#x27;%20y1=&#x27;39&#x27;%20x2=&#x27;410&#x27;%20y2=&#x27;79&#x27;%20gradientUnits=&#x27;userSpaceOnUse&#x27;%3e%3cstop%20stop-color=&#x27;%23ED2E28&#x27;%20stop-opacity=&#x27;0.51&#x27;/%3e%3cstop%20offset=&#x27;1&#x27;%20stop-color=&#x27;%23ED2E28&#x27;%20stop-opacity=&#x27;0&#x27;/%3e%3c/linearGradient%3e%3clinearGradient%20id=&#x27;paint1_linear_1_2&#x27;%20x1=&#x27;118&#x27;%20y1=&#x27;156&#x27;%20x2=&#x27;98&#x27;%20y2=&#x27;196&#x27;%20gradientUnits=&#x27;userSpaceOnUse&#x27;%3e%3cstop%20stop-color=&#x27;%23ED2E28&#x27;%20stop-opacity=&#x27;0.51&#x27;/%3e%3cstop%20offset=&#x27;1&#x27;%20stop-color=&#x27;%23ED2E28&#x27;%20stop-opacity=&#x27;0&#x27;/%3e%3c/linearGradient%3e%3clinearGradient%20id=&#x27;paint2_linear_1_2&#x27;%20x1=&#x27;235&#x27;%20y1=&#x27;117&#x27;%20x2=&#x27;215&#x27;%20y2=&#x27;157&#x27;%20gradientUnits=&#x27;userSpaceOnUse&#x27;%3e%3cstop%20stop-color=&#x27;%23ED2E28&#x27;%20stop-opacity=&#x27;0.51&#x27;/%3e%3cstop%20offset=&#x27;1&#x27;%20stop-color=&#x27;%23ED2E28&#x27;%20stop-opacity=&#x27;0&#x27;/%3e%3c/linearGradient%3e%3clinearGradient%20id=&#x27;paint3_linear_1_2&#x27;%20x1=&#x27;157&#x27;%20y1=&#x27;195&#x27;%20x2=&#x27;137&#x27;%20y2=&#x27;235&#x27;%20gradientUnits=&#x27;userSpaceOnUse&#x27;%3e%3cstop%20stop-color=&#x27;%23ED2E28&#x27;%20stop-opacity=&#x27;0.51&#x27;/%3e%3cstop%20offset=&#x27;1&#x27;%20stop-color=&#x27;%23ED2E28&#x27;%20stop-opacity=&#x27;0&#x27;/%3e%3c/linearGradient%3e%3c/defs%3e%3c/svg%3e" alt="Abstract square illustration"/></div><div class="p-4 space-y-1.5"><div class="text-branding-red text-r8-2xl lg:text-r8-3xl font-semibold font-heading"><h4>Forget about infrastructure</h4></div><div class="text-white text-r8-lg"><p>Deploying machine learning models at scale is hard. If you&#x27;ve tried, you know. API servers, weird dependencies, enormous model weights, CUDA, GPUs, batching.</p></div></div></div><div class="border-l border-t border-branding-red"><div class="min-h-[14rem] mb-8 relative"><div class="divide-branding-red/50 divide-y"><div class="py-4"><div class="h-[160px]"></div><div class="px-3 pt-3"><p class="text-r8-sm tracking-tight font-semibold">Prediction throughput<!-- --> <span class="font-normal">(requests per second)</span></p></div></div></div></div><div class="p-4 space-y-1.5"><div class="text-branding-red text-r8-2xl lg:text-r8-3xl font-semibold font-heading"><h4>Logging &amp; monitoring</h4></div><div class="text-white text-r8-lg"><p>Metrics let you keep an eye on how your models are performing, and logs let you zoom in on particular predictions to debug how your model is behaving.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><section id="imagine-what-you-can-build"><div class="container mx-auto"><div class="relative"><div class="absolute left-10 top-0 h-[8.2rem] w-[4.2rem] bg-r8-gray-1 pointer-events-none hidden lg:flex aspect-square justify-between"><div class="w-px bg-gradient-to-b dark:from-branding-red from-branding-red/50 to-white"></div><div class="w-px bg-gradient-to-b dark:from-branding-red from-branding-red/50 to-white"></div><div class="w-px bg-gradient-to-b dark:from-branding-red from-branding-red/50 to-white"></div></div><div class="absolute left-10 top-[8.2rem] h-[4.2rem] w-[4.2rem] text-r8-gray-1 bg-branding-red p-4 pointer-events-none hidden lg:flex aspect-square justify-between"><svg version="1.1" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xml:space="preserve" viewBox="0 0 1000 1000" fill="currentColor"><title>Replicate logo</title><g><polygon points="1000,427.6 1000,540.6 603.4,540.6 603.4,1000 477,1000 477,427.6"></polygon><polygon points="1000,213.8 1000,327 364.8,327 364.8,1000 238.4,1000 238.4,213.8"></polygon><polygon points="1000,0 1000,113.2 126.4,113.2 126.4,1000 0,1000 0,0"></polygon></g></svg></div><div class="pt-16 lg:pt-40"><div class="pb-16 lg:pb-24"><div class="block lg:hidden"><h2 class="text-r8-5xl font-bold font-heading">Imagine what you can build</h2><ul class="space-y-8 mt-6"><a href="https://twitter.com/hupobuboo/status/1727316167138886118?s=20" class="flex bg-white grid-item h-52 w-full border-black border transition-colors relative group"><div class="flex-1 p-4 flex fl